OL,3,GNEWSAChildren in Need donations improve
OL,4,Alives with osteopathy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Osteopathic Centre for Children at
OL,7,FTower Bridge is busy with families
OL,8,Freceiving treatment on a "pay what you
OL,9,Fcan" basis.
OL,11,FThe co-founder, Stuart Korth, said
OL,12,Fwithout Children in Need funding, they
OL,13,F"couldn't exist" because there are not
OL,14,Fenough donations from patients to run a
OL,15,Fclinic.
OL,17,FOne child having treatment at the
OL,18,FLondon facility is 14-year-old Hendrix.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
